[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3856.39, "timestamp": "01:04:16", "text": "我覺得今天的開銷，今天的開銷，就像今天我買的東西，大概花了多少錢，大概3000日圓。我喜歡麵包，對吧？是的。而且我有一張卡，我得花更多錢。因為現在，我的薪水要到下週才能到帳。所以，這就像一把磚頭錘。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3868.39, "timestamp": "01:04:28", "text": "你可以用它來敲人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3871.91, "timestamp": "01:04:31", "text": "七夕節還在繼續。是的，我們可以……就從"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3888.11, "timestamp": "01:04:48", "author": "@MikazukiYure", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/uuFSD7qVrZy0JUWrBRfSfEKIQpib7_2xP24Yiu1ND1Mq6uhaYIHDnA5EiGz_o33FUhHYvbCT9g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/PVfsZ8LuIYCO_9EPt-GMgAw"}]